# Module definition for the shell's shared root components.
#
# Two things make this file mandatory rather than optional:
#
#  - A `pragma Singleton` file with no qmldir entry resolves to the
#    uninstantiated TYPE, not its instance, so `Tokens.radiusMd` reads as
#    undefined — which QML renders as 0 without raising an error. Silent.
#  - Once a qmldir exists it REPLACES implicit same-directory resolution, so
#    every component here has to be listed, not just the singletons.
singleton Tokens 1.0 Tokens.qml
singleton Accent 1.0 Accent.qml
singleton Time 1.0 Time.qml

Surface 1.0 Surface.qml
Glyph 1.0 Glyph.qml
